# yangzhou REST API 手测脚本(IntelliJ HTTP Client)
#
# 用法(2026-11-08 定:本文件属自动化测试,只在 test 环境跑,不进 dev):
#   1. 起 test 容器:script/app-infra.ps1 up test(api 8082;改过后端先 rebuild)
#   2. 打开本文件,右上角环境选 `test`
#   3. 空库首次才需手动跑「Bootstrap」(e2e globalSetup 清库后会自动补种子账号,通常免)
#   4. 整文件自上而下按序跑——不要单点中间请求:变量靠上文响应回填,单点会踩上一轮的过期值
#      (例外:spec 0113/0114 节自含,跑过「登录」后可单跑该节;重跑该节前先重跑「登录」)
#
# 可重复跑:登录时每轮生成唯一后缀(变量 run),新建一套项目/成员/团队,不与历史数据冲突 → 全绿。
# test 库随时会被 e2e globalSetup 清空——无妨,本文件每轮自建全新项目,不依赖库内历史数据。
# 文件末尾「负例区」的红色(409)是预期行为,故意演示约束生效。
# 提示:注释里不写双花括号变量引用——IDEA 会对注释也做变量替换,未替换就报「请求无效」。

### ============ 0. Bootstrap(仅首次部署跑一次;之后再跑会 409 已初始化,属预期) ============

POST {{host}}/api/auth/bootstrap
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "me",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### ============ 1. 登录(生成 token 与本轮唯一后缀) ============

### 登录
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "me",
  "password": "secret123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
    client.global.set("run", Date.now().toString().slice(-6)); // 每轮唯一后缀,保证可重复执行
    client.global.set("meId", response.body.memberId); // 本人 id(TokenResponse 自带,免去列表里找 me)
 %}

### ============ 2. 项目(新 key = CHE + 后缀;后续 URL 用变量 pkey) ============

### 建项目(handler 存变量 pkey)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "CHE{{run}}",
  "name": "扬州演示 {{run}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("pkey", response.body.key);
 %}

### 项目详情(默认工作流:第 1/2 个状态名存为变量 statusFrom / statusTo)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("statusFrom", response.body.statuses[0].name);
    client.global.set("statusTo", response.body.statuses[1].name);
 %}

### 甘特数据(YPJ-204/spec 0137:行含 blocked/estimateValue/estimateUnit;响应不回填;YPJ-220:缺省 scope=board;YPJ-255:行增 totalMinutes 工时合计,覆盖进度兜底用)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/gantt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 甘特范围(scope 五选;YPJ-220/spec 0141)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/gantt?scope=all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### item 排期时刻级(YPJ-208/spec 0138:date-only 由后端按工作日界默认 09:00/18:00;datetime 原样;handler 存 pkey208)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "208 排期时刻 item {{pkey208}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("item208", response.body.itemId);
 %}

### PATCH date-only → 默认时刻(响应 startDate 含 T09:00)
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item208}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-11-21",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-25"
}

### PATCH datetime 原样(响应含 T14:30)
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item208}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-11-21T14:30"
}

### PATCH estimate 显式改+start → due 按预估重算(YPJ-243/spec 0150 后写者为准;响应 dueDate=T14:00 + warnings 含「重算」)
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item208}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-11-23",
  "estimateValue": "5",
  "estimateUnit": "hour"
}

### [预期 400] 非法日期格式
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item208}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "not-a-date"
}

### [预期 400] 甘特数据——未知项目
GET {{host}}/api/projects/NOPE77/gantt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 项目设置——关 milestone 开关(YPJ-151;null=不改)
PATCH {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "milestoneEnabled": false
}

### 项目设置——重开(幂等恢复默认)
PATCH {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "releaseEnabled": true,
  "milestoneEnabled": true
}

### 项目设置——工作量刻度整体替换 + required(YPJ-180)
PATCH {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estimateScales": [
    { "key": "xs", "label": "微", "value": 2, "unit": "day" },
    { "key": "s", "label": "小", "value": 3, "unit": "day" },
    { "key": "m", "label": "中", "value": 5, "unit": "day" },
    { "key": "l", "label": "大", "value": 8, "unit": "day" },
    { "key": "xl", "label": "超大", "value": 13, "unit": "day" }
  ],
  "estimateRequired": false
}

> {%
    if (response.body.estimateScales && response.body.estimateScales.length > 0) {
        client.global.set("estimateLabel", response.body.estimateScales[0].label);
    }
 %}

### 项目列表
GET {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============ 3. 属性词表(名字带本轮后缀,防重名 409) ============

### 建属性 A(handler 存变量 attrA)
POST {{host}}/api/attributes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java{{run}}",
  "kind": "skill",
  "leveled": true
}

> {%
    client.global.set("attrA", response.body.name);
 %}

### 建属性 B(handler 存变量 attrB)
POST {{host}}/api/attributes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "React{{run}}",
  "kind": "skill",
  "leveled": true
}

> {%
    client.global.set("attrB", response.body.name);
 %}

### 建 custom 属性(YPJ-103,item 自定义属性用;handler 存变量 attrCustom)
POST {{host}}/api/attributes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "模块{{run}}",
  "kind": "custom"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("attrCustom", response.body.name);
 %}

### 属性列表
GET {{host}}/api/attributes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============ 4. 成员 ============

### 建虚拟成员 小李(handler 存变量 memberId1)
POST {{host}}/api/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "小李{{run}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("memberId1", response.body.memberId);
 %}

### 建虚拟成员 小王(handler 存变量 memberId2)
POST {{host}}/api/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "小王{{run}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("memberId2", response.body.memberId);
 %}

### 成员列表
GET {{host}}/api/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

(meId 已在登录 handler 回填——TokenResponse 自带,此处不再做 JS 捕获)

### ============ 5. 能力 ============

### 我:属性A 等级 4
PUT {{host}}/api/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attribute": "{{attrA}}",
  "level": 4
}

### 小李:属性A 等级 3
PUT {{host}}/api/members/{{memberId1}}/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attribute": "{{attrA}}",
  "level": 3
}

### 小李:属性B 等级 3(全绿候选)
PUT {{host}}/api/members/{{memberId1}}/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attribute": "{{attrB}}",
  "level": 3
}

### 小王:属性B 等级 1(差候选)
PUT {{host}}/api/members/{{memberId2}}/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attribute": "{{attrB}}",
  "level": 1
}

### 我的能力列表
GET {{host}}/api/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 小李的能力
GET {{host}}/api/members/{{memberId1}}/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============ 6. 项目成员池(V3.5-B) ============
# 池语义:无行 = 全 workspace 可用;有行 = 仅池内可指派/进候选。
# 主链只演示正常路径:加小李 + 加小王 → 列出 → 移出小王 → 加我入池(13 区工时按本人计时)→ 池内剩小李、我。
# 想体验「无池兼容」:跳过本区直接跑第 8 区。

### 加入池:小李
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": "{{memberId1}}"
}

### 加入池:小王
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": "{{memberId2}}"
}

### 池列表(按加入顺序)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 移出池:小王 → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/members/{{memberId2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 加入池:我(13 区开计时/停计时按当前登录人,须在池内)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": "{{meId}}"
}

### 设 leader(YPJ-102;创建者已是 leader,幂等确认)
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/members/{{meId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"leader"}

### ============ 7. Item ============

### 建 item(要求属性B≥2;handler 存变量 itemId)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "写前端看板",
  "description": "演示用",
  "requirements": [
    { "attribute": "{{attrB}}", "minLevel": 2 }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("itemId", response.body.itemId);
 %}

### item 列表(key-N 编号)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### item 详情
GET {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 改标题
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "写前端看板(改)"
}

### 预估:设置(成对 value+unit,快照语义;YPJ-186)
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estimateValue": "5",
  "estimateUnit": "day"
}

### 预估:清除(空对;required 开启时此请求 400,见负例区)
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estimateValue": "",
  "estimateUnit": ""
}

### 整体替换需求(含显式 null = 不设等级)
PUT {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/requirements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requirements": [
    { "attribute": "{{attrB}}", "minLevel": 2 },
    { "attribute": "{{attrA}}", "minLevel": null }
  ]
}

### 整体替换 item 自定义属性(YPJ-103;仅 custom 类词表,值≤500 文本)
PUT {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/attributes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "values": [
    { "attribute": "{{attrCustom}}", "value": "支付网关" }
  ]
}

### ============ 8. 指派 / 候选 / 可行性 ============

### 指派小李(池内 → 200)
PUT {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/assignee
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneeItemId": "{{memberId1}}"
}

### 取消指派
PUT {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/assignee
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneeItemId": null
}

### 候选建议(配置池后仅池内;绿黄红判定逐条可解释)
GET {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/candidates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 单人可行性
GET {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/feasibility
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 团队分配建议(项目级)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/feasibility
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============ 9. 工作流(状态名动态取自项目详情,兼容任何默认工作流) ============

### 加自定义状态(新项目内名字唯一,不冲突)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/statuses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "评审",
  "position": 3
}

### 迁移规则列表(状态出边内嵌;出边空数组 = 自由迁移)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/transitions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 配置迁移(用项目详情抓到的两个状态名)
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/transitions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transitions": [
    { "from": "{{statusFrom}}", "to": "{{statusTo}}", "function": "switch" }
  ]
}

### ============ 10. 团队(纯分组,不影响匹配) ============

### 建团队(handler 存变量 teamId)
POST {{host}}/api/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "前端组{{run}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("teamId", response.body.teamId);
 %}

### 小李入组
POST {{host}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": "{{memberId1}}"
}

### 团队列表
GET {{host}}/api/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============ 11. Sprint(V12-S1,spec 0010) ============
# 语义:同一 item 至多属于一个 planned/active sprint(替换式写入);
# 完成 sprint 的成员关系是历史,不可变;组不进匹配输入。
# spec 0100 切片B:新项目不再种子 sprint 类型,先建 timed level-1 类型(本轮新项目必成功,无重名)。

### 建 sprint 类型(timed level-1)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/group-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeKey": "sprint",
  "name": "Sprint",
  "timed": true
}

### 建 Sprint(统一组端点;handler 存变量 sprintId;日期可选,格式 yyyy-MM-dd)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeKey": "sprint",
  "name": "Sprint 42",
  "startDate": "2026-10-01",
  "endDate": "2026-10-15"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("sprintId", response.body.groupId);
 %}

### 建 item 直入 Sprint(YPJ-56:创建请求带 sprintId,同事务归入;handler 存 itemIdSprint)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "建票直入 sprint",
  "groupId": "{{sprintId}}",
  "groupType": "sprint"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("itemIdSprint", response.body.itemId);
 %}

### YPJ-216(spec 0164):拉入排期守卫——预估必填项目,直入组的票无预估 → 409
### (前置:PATCH settings {"estimateRequired":true};预期 409:响应含「拉入组须先填预估」;同事务不落库)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "无预估票——直入 sprint 应 409",
  "groupId": "{{sprintId}}",
  "groupType": "sprint"
}

### YPJ-216(spec 0164):组拉入缺省设置(甘特缺省画图输入;null=不改,未设置渲染回退中档/组开始)
PATCH {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "defaultEstimateValue": "3",
  "defaultEstimateUnit": "day",
  "defaultStartOffsetMinutes": 60
}

### YPJ-216:有预估票直入组 → 200,start=今天,due=铺算回填(响应含 startDate/dueDate)
### (前端:先建无日期票再 PUT membership 亦可;此处验证 create 直挂路径)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "有预估票——直入 sprint 自动排期",
  "estimateValue": "4",
  "estimateUnit": "hour",
  "groupId": "{{sprintId}}",
  "groupType": "sprint"
}

### Sprint 列表(统一 /groups?type=sprint)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/groups?type=sprint
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 组详情
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/groups/{{sprintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 生命周期派生字段(YPJ-269/spec 0174):详情响应增 createdAt/startedAt/completedAt/firstItemStartedAt/lastItemCompletedAt——
### 零物化,读时从 group_status_history 派生;列表端点恒 null;存量组开始/完成 "" (null)。上帧 start/complete 后重跑本节看值。
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/groups/{{sprintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 组时间线(YPJ-284/spec 0175):DESC 后进先见;kind=status(组迁移)/member(+加入/−移出);存量组经成员史即有数据
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/groups/{{sprintId}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 开始 Sprint(动作端点:planned→active;PATCH 不再管 status)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/groups/{{sprintId}}/actions/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active"
}

### 指派 item 到 Sprint(按类型替换归属)
PUT {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/group-membership
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": "{{sprintId}}",
  "groupType": "sprint"
}

### 看板拉入/退回(spec 0099:on_board 标记;拉入同时挂最早 active sprint,退回同时移出非 completed 成员行)
PUT {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/board-membership
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "onBoard": true
}

### 组内 items(完成后仍含历史行)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/groups/{{sprintId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### backlog 派生桶(非终态且未进任何 planned/active sprint;此刻不含已指派的 item)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/backlog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### backlog 派生桶(非终态且未进任何 planned/active sprint;此刻不含已指派的 item)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/backlog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============ 11b. GroupType / 通用组(YPJ-48,spec 0056;自定义类型走最小语义) ============

### 类型列表(YPJ-165 后新项目无内建类型;此处为空或用户自配)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/group-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 建自定义类型 quarter(handler 存变量 gtypeKey)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/group-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeKey": "quarter",
  "name": "季度"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("gtypeKey", response.body.typeKey);
%}

### 改类型名
PATCH {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/group-types/{{gtypeKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "季度(改)"
}

### 建通用组(handler 存变量 groupIdCustom)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeKey": "{{gtypeKey}}",
  "name": "2026-Q1",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01",
  "endDate": "2026-03-31"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("groupIdCustom", response.body.groupId);
%}

### 通用组列表
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/groups?type={{gtypeKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 改通用组(状态 active)
PATCH {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/groups/{{groupIdCustom}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active"
}

### 删通用组
DELETE {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/groups/{{groupIdCustom}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 删自定义类型
DELETE {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/group-types/{{gtypeKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== spec 0100 切片B:层级化类型(去内置 sprint;可删性=空即可删,保留字废除) ==========

### 建类型列表(YPJ-165 后新项目无内建类型;sprint 由用户加 level 自配)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/group-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 建 timed 类型(handler 存变量 l1Key;无 level-1 时自动补位 level 1)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/group-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
