### ============ 11b. Release(YPJ-191,spec 0132;V63 独立实体) ============
# Release = 交付事件(planned → released 单向终态);stage 是成熟度属性非状态;
# version 归组维度非实体;RC 序号不建模,靠 name。

### 建 release(普通;handler 存变量 releaseId)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/releases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "1.0 {{run}}",
  "targetDate": "2026-12-31"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("releaseId", response.body.releaseId);
 %}

### 建 stage release(version + stage;handler 存变量 releaseStageId)
