Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "1.0 RC2 {{run}}",
  "version": "1.0",
  "stage": "rc"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("releaseStageId", response.body.releaseId);
 %}

### Release 列表(planned 前 targetDate 升序,released 后按发布日倒序;YPJ-203 起带 overdue/doneCount/totalCount)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/releases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 发布(planned → released;releasedDate 缺省 = 今天)
