### YPJ-39 补挂既有分支到从票(纯库操作不走 GitHub;404 未入册 / 409 重复、PR 行、跨项目未挂载)
### repo/branch 由上方建分支请求回填;须先跑建分支
### 建分支 409=分支已存在(换名或沿用);只要建分支成功过一次,回填变量即在
POST {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId2}}/git-refs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repo": "{{attachRepo}}",
  "ref": "{{attachRef}}"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 200) {
      client.global.set("attachRepo", response.body.repo);
      client.global.set("attachRef", response.body.branch);
    }
%}

### 按需拉取 item 分支的提交历史(不落库不依赖轮询;无 PAT/无挂载 400 可操作报错)
GET {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/commits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============ 13. 工时(V8-S3;V16-3 起止补录 + 工时建议) ============

### 开计时(minutes 空 = 计时;全局唯一,开新自动停旧)
POST {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/time-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minutes": null
}

> {%
    if (!response.body.timeEntryId) throw new Error("开计时未返回 timeEntryId(查上方请求状态/响应体): " + JSON.stringify(response.body));
    client.global.set("timeEntryId", response.body.timeEntryId);
    client.log("[api.http] timeEntryId=" + client.global.get("timeEntryId"));
 %}

### 补录 minutes(与起止互斥;服务端按 now 往回推)
POST {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/time-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minutes": 90,
  "note": "下午改引擎"
}

### 起止补录(V16-3;工时建议落账走这里,ISO-8601)
POST {{host}}/api/items/{{itemId}}/time-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minutes": null,
  "startedAt": "2026-10-07T01:00:00Z",
  "endedAt": "2026-10-07T03:30:00Z",
  "note": "分支 cwjiang/YPJ-8-x 提交段"
}

### item 工时明细 + 合计
