GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/metrics/aging
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Burndown(sprint;需起止日期)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/metrics/burndown?groupId={{sprintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Burnup(sprint;scope 线 YPJ-54 留痕前口径受限,见 definitions)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/metrics/burnup?groupId={{sprintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Velocity:各 sprint 完成数(count 口径,非生产力 KPI)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/metrics/velocity

### scope-change(YPJ-54)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/metrics/scope-change?groupId={{sprintId}}

### reopen-rate(YPJ-54)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{pkey}}/metrics/reopen-rate?from=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

