Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "245 due-only 负例票" }

> {%
    client.global.set("item245", response.body.itemId);
%}

### [负例] 只带 due 无 start → 400「须先填开始日期」(存量 due-only 行不受影响)
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item245}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dueDate": "2026-12-01" }

### [正例] start+due 同发 → 200(排期窗口;date-only due = 当日日末 23:59:59)
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item245}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startDate": "2026-11-23", "dueDate": "2026-12-01" }

### [正例·回归钉] 只带 due 的 PATCH → 200 且存量 start 保持(旧码把 start 抹成 null,已修)
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item245}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dueDate": "2026-12-02" }

> {%
    const d = response.body;
    if (d.startDate !== "2026-11-23T00:00") throw new Error("start 被抹:" + d.startDate);
    if (d.dueDate !== "2026-12-02T23:59:59") throw new Error("due 异常:" + d.dueDate);
    client.log("start 保持 ✓ due=2026-12-02T23:59:59 ✓");
%}

### [负例] 清 start 残留 due → 400(结果态判定)
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item245}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startDate": "" }

### 清场:删一次性项目(.force 物理删)
DELETE {{host}}/api/projects/{{key245}}?force=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============ 18. YPJ-238 看板列内箭头排序(spec 0166 §3.1 move;节内自建前置) ============
### 建一次性 S0 项目(handler 存 key238;不播种 sprint 类型 = 无组语义)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"key": "BO238", "name": "238 手测"}

> {% client.global.set("key238", response.body.key); %}

