### ============ 21. YPJ-274 item 关闭理由(spec 0167;节内自建前置) ============
### 建一次性 S0 项目(自动带三态 workflow:To Do / In Progress / Done)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"key": "CR274", "name": "274 手测"}

> {%
    client.global.set("key274", response.body.key);
    const s = response.body.statuses;
    client.global.set("st274todo", s.find(x => x.name === "To Do").statusId);
    client.global.set("st274prog", s.find(x => x.name === "In Progress").statusId);
    client.global.set("st274done", s.find(x => x.name === "Done").statusId);
    if (s.find(x => x.name === "Done").requireCloseReason !== false) throw new Error("新建状态缺省应为 false");
    client.log("StatusDto.requireCloseReason 缺省 false ✓");
%}

### [正例] 状态开开关:In Progress → Done 须问理由
PATCH {{host}}/api/statuses/{{st274prog}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requireCloseReason": true }

> {% if (response.body.requireCloseReason !== true) throw new Error("开关未生效"); %}

### [正例] 省略 = 保持(不回退)
PATCH {{host}}/api/statuses/{{st274prog}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "icon": "🚧" }

> {% if (response.body.requireCloseReason !== true) throw new Error("省略应保持 true"); client.log("状态开关 设/保持 ✓"); %}

### 建票 + 指派(离开起点态须有主)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{key274}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "274-a"}

> {% client.global.set("item274a", response.body.itemId); %}

### 自指派(离开起点态须有主;创建者在池,meId 登录时已回填——同 §19 惯例)
PUT {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}/assignee
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneeItemId": "{{meId}}" }

> {% client.assert(response.status === 200, "指派应 200,实际 " + response.status); %}

### [正例①] 转终态不带理由 → 后端写 done;活动 newValue = "Done"
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "statusItemId": "{{st274done}}" }

> {%
    if (response.body.closeReason !== "done") throw new Error("缺省应为 done,实际:" + response.body.closeReason);
    client.log("转终态缺省 done ✓");
%}

### 活动留痕:status_changed newValue 纯 "Done"(不带括号)
GET {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    const a = response.body.find(x => x.kind === "status_changed");
    if (!a || a.newValue !== "Done") throw new Error("活动应为 Done,实际:" + JSON.stringify(a));
    client.log("done 活动不带括号 ✓");
%}

### [正例②] reopen → 理由清空
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "statusItemId": "{{st274prog}}" }

> {% if (response.body.closeReason !== null) throw new Error("reopen 应清空,实际:" + response.body.closeReason); client.log("reopen 清空 ✓"); %}

### [正例③] 转终态带理由 + 备注 → 写入;活动 newValue 带理由:备注
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "statusItemId": "{{st274done}}", "closeReason": "superseded", "closeNote": "被 274-b 取代" }

> {%
    if (response.body.closeReason !== "superseded" || response.body.closeNote !== "被 274-b 取代") throw new Error("理由/备注未写入");
    client.log("转终态带理由+备注 ✓");
%}

GET {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    const a = response.body.filter(x => x.kind === "status_changed").pop();
    if (a.newValue !== "Done(被取代:被 274-b 取代)") throw new Error("活动应为 Done(被取代:…),实际:" + a.newValue);
    client.log("活动带理由 ✓");
%}

### [正例④] 终态票只改理由(不动状态)→ close_reason_changed 活动
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "closeReason": "done" }

> {%
    if (response.body.closeReason !== "done" || response.body.closeNote !== null) throw new Error("改回 done 应清 note");
    client.log("改回 done 清 note ✓");
%}

GET {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    const a = response.body.filter(x => x.kind === "close_reason_changed").pop();
    if (!a || a.oldValue !== "被取代" || a.newValue !== "完成") throw new Error("close_reason_changed 异常:" + JSON.stringify(a));
    client.log("close_reason_changed 留痕 ✓");
%}

### [负例①] 非终态带理由 → 400
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "statusItemId": "{{st274prog}}", "closeReason": "wontfix" }

> {% client.assert(response.status === 400, "非终态带理由应 400,实际 " + response.status); %}

### [负例②] 非法枚举 → 400
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "closeReason": "nope" }

> {% client.assert(response.status === 400, "非法枚举应 400,实际 " + response.status); %}

### [负例③] 非终态票只改理由 → 400
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "statusItemId": "{{st274prog}}" }

### (接上,此时为 In Progress)
PATCH {{host}}/api/items/{{item274a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "closeReason": "wontfix" }

> {% client.assert(response.status === 400, "非终态票改理由应 400,实际 " + response.status); %}

### 清场:删一次性项目(force 物理删)
DELETE {{host}}/api/projects/{{key274}}?force=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================
### ============ 22. spec 0177(S1)认证基座(YPJ-288;节内自含:自带登录,先跑「登录」即可单跑本节) ============
### ============================================================
### 注意:自助改密会黑名单踢所有会话(含当前),改完即重登;节末把密码改回原值,整文件可重复跑。

### CLI 分型登录(ct=cli → TTL 30d;web 缺省 8h)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "me",
  "password": "secret123",
  "clientType": "cli"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("pwToken", response.body.token);
 %}

### 自助改密(≥8 位;成功踢所有会话,上面刚拿的 pwToken 即刻失效)
PUT {{host}}/api/members/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{pwToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "secret123",
  "newPassword": "spec177-pass"
}

### [预期 401] 改密后旧 token 被黑名单拒绝
GET {{host}}/api/members
Authorization: Bearer {{pwToken}}

> {% client.assert(response.status === 401, "改密后旧会话应 401,实际 " + response.status); %}

### 新密码重登
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "me",
  "password": "spec177-pass",
  "clientType": "cli"
}

> {% client.global.set("pwToken2", response.body.token); %}

### [预期 401] 旧密码不能再登
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "me",
  "password": "secret123"
}

> {% client.assert(response.status === 401, "旧密码应 401,实际 " + response.status); %}

### [负例] new < 8 位 → 400(pwToken2 仍有效,必须在「改回」之前——改密也踢自己)
PUT {{host}}/api/members/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{pwToken2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "spec177-pass",
  "newPassword": "short"
}

> {% client.assert(response.status === 400, "短密码应 400,实际 " + response.status); %}

### 改回原密码(整文件可重复跑;改后 pwToken2 即死,故放节末)
PUT {{host}}/api/members/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{pwToken2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "spec177-pass",
  "newPassword": "secret123"
}
